<title>INDIA: Cricket-India v South Africa scoreboard.</title>
<headline>Cricket-India v South Africa scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>AHMEDABAD, India 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of the first test between India and South Africa on Friday:</p>
<p>    India	  1st innings 223</p>
<p>    South Africa 1st innings 244</p>
<p>    India	  2nd innings:</p>
<p>Sanjay Manjrekar    c Hudson	  b   Donald	    5</p>
<p>Nayan Mongia	  c Richardson    d   Donald	    5</p>
<p>Rahul Dravid				lbw Symcox	   34</p>
<p>Sachin Tendulkar    c Rhodes	  b   McMillan	  7</p>
<p>Mohammad Azharuddin c McMillan	b   Donald	   24</p>
<p>V.V.S.Laxman				not out		50</p>
<p>Sunil Joshi	   c McMillan	b   Symcox	   13</p>
<p>Javagal Srinath			   lbw de Villiers     1</p>
<p>Anil Kumble				  not out	     22</p>
<p>Extras (4b, 4lb, 3nb)					    11</p>
<p>Total  (for seven wickets)  (off 74 overs)		172</p>
<p>Fall of wickets : 1-10, 2-15, 3-38, 4-82, 5-91, 6-123, 7-124.</p>
<p>Bowling: Donald 15-3-32-3 (2nb), de Villiers 17-4-45-1, McMillan 9-4-18-1, Symcox 19-2-37-2, Adams 7-3-22-0 (1nb), Cronje 7-2-10-0.</p>
